---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "US Voter Registration and Voting Requirements"
description: "Voter registration and voting requirements for all 50 US states and Washington DC, providing detailed information on deadlines, ID requirements, mail-in voting policies, recent election law news, and more."
---
<div class="home">
	<p class="intro">Voter registration and voting requirements for all 50 US states and Washington DC. Search by state name or use the filters below.</p>

	<div class="controls">
		<div class="search-wrap">
			<label for="state-search" class="sr-only">Search states</label>
			<input type="search" id="state-search" placeholder="Search by state name or abbreviation..." autocomplete="off">
		</div>
		<div class="filter-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Filter states">
			<button class="filter-btn" data-filter="same-day" aria-pressed="false">Same-Day Registration</button>
			<button class="filter-btn" data-filter="online" aria-pressed="false">Online Registration</button>
			<button class="filter-btn" data-filter="early" aria-pressed="false">Early Voting</button>
			<button class="filter-btn" data-filter="no-excuse" aria-pressed="false">No-Excuse Mail-In</button>
			<button class="filter-btn" data-filter="excuse-required" aria-pressed="false">Excuse Required Mail-In</button>
			<button class="filter-btn" data-filter="mail-in" aria-pressed="false">All Mail-In</button>
		</div>
	</div>

	<p class="result-count" aria-live="polite">Showing <span id="visible-count">{{ states | length }}</span> of {{ states | length }} (50 states + DC)</p>

	<div class="card-grid">
		{%- for state in states %}
		{% include "state-card.njk" %}
		{%- endfor %}
	</div>
</div>
